<div id="api-guide-page" class="space-y-6">
  <%!-- Status --%>
  <div id="guide-status" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-lg border border-base-200">
    <div class="card-body space-y-3">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3">
        <h2 class="card-title text-lg">
          <.icon name="hero-power" class="w-5 h-5" /> {gettext("Status")}
        </h2>
        <.button
          id="guide-switches-link"
          variant="outline"
          size="sm"
          patch={@guide.settings_path}
        >
          {gettext("Open the switches")}
        </.button>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm">
        <div id="guide-status-admin" data-enabled={to_string(@guide.admin_enabled)}>
          <span class="font-medium">{gettext("Admin API")}</span>
          <span class={[
            "badge badge-sm ml-2",
            if(@guide.admin_enabled, do: "badge-success", else: "badge-ghost")
          ]}>
            {if @guide.admin_enabled, do: gettext("Enabled"), else: gettext("Disabled")}
          </span>
        </div>
        <div id="guide-status-public" data-enabled={to_string(@guide.public_enabled)}>
          <span class="font-medium">{gettext("Public API")}</span>
          <span class={[
            "badge badge-sm ml-2",
            if(@guide.public_enabled, do: "badge-success", else: "badge-ghost")
          ]}>
            {if @guide.public_enabled, do: gettext("Enabled"), else: gettext("Disabled")}
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- Endpoints --%>
  <div id="guide-endpoints" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-lg border border-base-200">
    <div class="card-body space-y-4">
      <h2 class="card-title text-lg">
        <.icon name="hero-globe-alt" class="w-5 h-5" /> {gettext("Endpoints")}
      </h2>
      <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[12rem_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm">
        <dt class="font-medium">{gettext("Base URL")}</dt>
        <dd><code id="guide-base-url" class="font-mono break-all">{@guide.base_url}</code></dd>
        <dt class="font-medium">{gettext("REST")}</dt>
        <dd><code id="guide-rest-url" class="font-mono break-all">{@guide.rest_url}</code></dd>
        <dt class="font-medium">{gettext("MCP server")}</dt>
        <dd><code id="guide-mcp-url" class="font-mono break-all">{@guide.mcp_url}</code></dd>
        <dt class="font-medium">{gettext("OpenAPI document")}</dt>
        <dd>
          <code id="guide-openapi-url" class="font-mono break-all">{@guide.openapi_url}</code>
          <p class="text-base-content/70">
            {gettext("With a key it lists only the tools that key unlocks.")}
          </p>
        </dd>
      </dl>
      <p id="guide-domains-note" class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
        {gettext(
          "On a site with several domains every domain serves the same API; use the one your program can reach."
        )}
      </p>

      <div id="guide-headers" class="space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-medium">{gettext("Headers")}</h3>
        <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[18rem_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm">
          <dt><code class="font-mono">Authorization: Bearer &lt;your key&gt;</code></dt>
          <dd>
            {gettext(
              "The API key, as a Bearer token. Never put a key in a URL: such a request is refused."
            )}
          </dd>
          <dt><code class="font-mono">Idempotency-Key</code></dt>
          <dd>
            {gettext(
              "Makes the retry of a write call safe. Over MCP, send idempotency_key as an argument instead."
            )}
          </dd>
          <dt>
            <code class="font-mono">RateLimit-Limit</code>
            <code class="font-mono">RateLimit-Remaining</code>
            <code class="font-mono">RateLimit-Reset</code>
            <code class="font-mono">Retry-After</code>
          </dt>
          <dd>
            {gettext(
              "How many calls the key has left in the window and when it resets. After a 429, Retry-After says how many seconds to wait."
            )}
          </dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- Connect a client --%>
  <div id="guide-connect" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-lg border border-base-200">
    <div class="card-body space-y-4">
      <h2 class="card-title text-lg">
        <.icon name="hero-link" class="w-5 h-5" /> {gettext("Connect a client")}
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
        {gettext(
          "Give the program a key that holds only the scopes it needs. Create it on Settings -> API."
        )}
      </p>
      <div id="guide-key-warning" role="note" class="alert alert-warning text-sm">
        <.icon name="hero-exclamation-triangle" class="w-5 h-5" />
        <span>
          {gettext(
            "Replace <your key> with the key. Never commit a key to a repository or paste it into a file others can read."
          )}
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
        {gettext(
          "The server name ends in -admin so that it does not clash with the public server of this site."
        )}
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-1">
        <h3 class="font-medium">{gettext("Claude Code")}</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
          {gettext(
            "Run this in your project folder. It is saved in your local scope, not in the file the team shares."
          )}
        </p>
        <pre class="bg-base-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs overflow-x-auto"><code id="guide-claude-code-command">{@guide.claude_code_command}</code></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-1">
        <h3 class="font-medium">{gettext("Cursor")}</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
          {gettext("Cursor reads this user file for every project, so no repository holds it:")}
          <code id="guide-cursor-file" class="font-mono">~/.cursor/mcp.json</code>
        </p>
        <pre class="bg-base-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs overflow-x-auto"><code id="guide-cursor-config">{@guide.cursor_config}</code></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-1">
        <h3 class="font-medium">{gettext("VS Code")}</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
          {gettext("Save it in your project folder as:")}
          <code id="guide-vscode-file" class="font-mono">.vscode/mcp.json</code>. {gettext(
            "VS Code asks for the key when the server starts and keeps it out of the file."
          )}
        </p>
        <pre class="bg-base-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs overflow-x-auto"><code id="guide-vscode-config">{@guide.vscode_config}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- Tools --%>
  <div id="guide-tools" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-lg border border-base-200">
    <div class="card-body space-y-4">
      <div>
        <h2 class="card-title text-lg">
          <.icon name="hero-wrench-screwdriver" class="w-5 h-5" /> {gettext("Tools")}
        </h2>
        <p id="guide-tools-note" class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
          {gettext("A key sees only the tools its scopes unlock.")}
          {gettext(
            "Tools switched off one by one, and the tools of a module whose API is switched off, are not listed."
          )}
          {gettext(
            "Any write tool may also ask for confirmation when a call touches more rows than the limit under Dangerous operations."
          )}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div :for={group <- @guide.tool_groups} id={group.dom_id} class="space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-medium">{group.label}</h3>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="table table-sm">
            <tbody>
              <tr :for={tool <- group.tools} id={tool.dom_id}>
                <td class="align-top">
                  <div :if={tool.title}>{tool.title}</div>
                  <div class="font-mono text-xs text-base-content/60">
                    <code class="guide-tool-name">{tool.name}</code>
                    <code class="guide-tool-mcp-name">{tool.mcp_name}</code>
                  </div>
                </td>
                <td class="align-top">
                  <code :if={tool.scope} class="font-mono text-xs">{tool.scope}</code>
                </td>
                <td class="align-top space-x-1">
                  <span
                    :if={tool.writes?}
                    class="guide-tool-writes badge badge-sm badge-warning"
                  >
                    {gettext("Writes")}
                  </span>
                  <span :if={not tool.writes?} class="badge badge-sm badge-ghost">
                    {gettext("Read only")}
                  </span>
                  <span
                    :if={tool.confirms?}
                    class="guide-tool-confirm badge badge-sm badge-info"
                  >
                    {gettext("May ask for confirmation")}
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- Keys --%>
  <div id="guide-keys" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-lg border border-base-200">
    <div class="card-body space-y-3">
      <h2 class="card-title text-lg">
        <.icon name="hero-key" class="w-5 h-5" /> {gettext("Keys")}
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm">
        <li>
          {gettext(
            "A key acts as its owner. A call may do what the key's scopes allow and the owner's permissions allow at that moment: take a permission from the owner and the key loses it on the next call."
          )}
        </li>
        <li>
          {gettext(
            "For a program, give the key to a service user: an account without a login that holds only the roles you choose."
          )}
        </li>
        <li>
          {gettext(
            "A key is shown once, when it is created. If it leaks, revoke it. To replace it, rotate it: the old key can keep working for a grace period you choose."
          )}
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- Personal keys --%>
  <div id="guide-personal-keys" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-lg border border-base-200">
    <div class="card-body space-y-3">
      <h2 class="card-title text-lg">
        <.icon name="hero-finger-print" class="w-5 h-5" /> {gettext("Personal keys")}
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm">
        <li>
          {gettext(
            "A personal key is a person's key for themselves: it acts with that person's own rights, always has an expiry, and never needs approval."
          )}
        </li>
        <li>
          {gettext(
            "To allow it, give a role the “Personal API keys” permission (Users, Roles, or the permissions matrix). An Admin does not get it by itself. The person makes the keys at %{path}.",
            path: @guide.personal_keys_path
          )}
        </li>
        <li>
          {gettext(
            "The Owner sees personal keys in the keys list. The Owner can revoke one or remove scopes from it, but cannot rotate it or add scopes."
          )}
        </li>
        <li>
          {gettext(
            "Someone who signs in as a person directly, not as a second account in the same session, with that person's own password, for example after an administrator reset it, can make a key as that person."
          )}
        </li>
        <li>
          {gettext(
            "A person never has more live personal keys than the limit set under “Switches and modules”, a key in the grace period of a rotation included. At the limit, a key can only be rotated with a grace period of 0, which stops the old key at once."
          )}
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- Dangerous operations --%>
  <div id="guide-danger" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-lg border border-base-200">
    <div class="card-body space-y-3">
      <h2 class="card-title text-lg">
        <.icon name="hero-shield-exclamation" class="w-5 h-5" /> {gettext("Dangerous operations")}
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
        {gettext(
          "A write tool takes three optional fields: in the body over REST, as arguments over MCP."
        )}
      </p>
      <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm">
        <dt><code class="font-mono">dry_run</code></dt>
        <dd>{gettext("Runs the tool without changing anything and returns a preview.")}</dd>
        <dt><code class="font-mono">confirm_token</code></dt>
        <dd>
          {ngettext(
            "A dangerous operation first returns a preview and a one-time code. Repeat the same call with confirm_token set to that code within %{count} second.",
            "A dangerous operation first returns a preview and a one-time code. Repeat the same call with confirm_token set to that code within %{count} seconds.",
            @guide.confirm_ttl_seconds
          )}
          {ngettext(
            "Any write that touches more than %{count} row is dangerous too.",
            "Any write that touches more than %{count} rows is dangerous too.",
            @guide.confirm_batch_over
          )}
        </dd>
        <dt><code class="font-mono">idempotency_key</code></dt>
        <dd>
          {ngettext(
            "16 to 128 characters: letters, digits, - and _. The same key with the same arguments returns the first answer instead of running twice; answers are kept for %{count} hour.",
            "16 to 128 characters: letters, digits, - and _. The same key with the same arguments returns the first answer instead of running twice; answers are kept for %{count} hours.",
            @guide.idempotency_ttl_hours
          )}
        </dd>
      </dl>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3">
        <p class="text-sm">
          {ngettext(
            "A key that requires approval does not run any write, dangerous or not: the call returns pending_approval and waits up to %{count} hour for a person to approve it.",
            "A key that requires approval does not run any write, dangerous or not: the call returns pending_approval and waits up to %{count} hours for a person to approve it.",
            @guide.approval_ttl_hours
          )}
        </p>
        <.button
          id="guide-approvals-link"
          variant="outline"
          size="sm"
          navigate={@guide.approvals_path}
        >
          {gettext("Review approvals")}
        </.button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- Errors --%>
  <div id="guide-errors" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-lg border border-base-200">
    <div class="card-body space-y-3">
      <div>
        <h2 class="card-title text-lg">
          <.icon name="hero-exclamation-circle" class="w-5 h-5" /> {gettext("Errors")}
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
          {gettext(
            "An error is a problem+json document with a stable code. Branch on the code, not on the text."
          )}
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="table table-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>{gettext("Status")}</th>
              <th>{gettext("Code")}</th>
              <th>{gettext("What to do")}</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr :for={error <- @guide.errors} id={"guide-error-#{error.code}"}>
              <td class="font-mono">{error.status}</td>
              <td><code class="font-mono">{error.code}</code></td>
              <td>{error.advice}</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
